# Smolderweb Carrier from En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (Lower Blackrock Spire).
# Sources: quests.json (Kibler's quest); items.json (the eggs come from egg
# objects); Lower Blackrock Spire (55-60) is in Forever;
# Forever client 1.60.1.70338. The reward is general Era knowledge.

step Kibler at Flame Crest
  tip Kibler stands at Flame Crest in northern Burning Steppes, near the Blackrock Mountain path.
  accept 4862

step Lower Blackrock Spire
  tip Lower Blackrock Spire is a group of five, level 55-60. Collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs from the nests near Mother Smolderweb.
  collect 12530 quest 4862 @33.2,24.9 -- Lower Blackrock Spire

step Back to Kibler
  turnin 4862
  collect 12529 @65.9,21.9            -- Smolderweb Carrier
